  "question": "Where are a museum located within a 120 kilometers radius to the north of Broadbent Arena, Louisville, KY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.745629 38.200638)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.745629 38.200638)',4326)::geography, 120000)\nAND tourism = 'museum'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
